{% extends 'v2/options/base.j2' %}
{% set section = 'help' %}
{% block title %}Help{% endblock %}
{% block head %}
	{{ super() }}
	<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bowser@2" type="application/javascript"></script>
{% endblock %}
{% block user_settings %}
<script>
let user_settings = {};
const mod_user_settings = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(user_settings));
</script>
{% endblock %}
{% block content %}

<div class="text-container" id="bug_report">
	<h4>Report a bug or give feedback</h4>
	<p>Did you experience some kind of odd behavior or find a bug? Or do you want to provide some feedback to the developers of Improved Intra? You can do so using <a href="https://github.com/FreekBes/improved_intra/issues?q=" target="_blank">GitHub Issues</a> in the Improved Intra repository.</p>
</div>

<div class="text-container" id="developing">
	<h4>Fix a bug or add a feature</h4>
	<p>Do you want to help improve 42's Intranet? If you would like to add a feature or fix a bug yourself, you can do so by cloning the <a href="https://github.com/FreekBes/improved_intra" target="_blank">Improved Intra repository on GitHub</a> and creating a pull request once you're done.</p>
	<p>Additionally, there is a <a href="https://github.com/FreekBes/improved_intra_server" target="_blank">second repository</a> just for the back-end of the extension.</p>
</div>

<div class="text-container" id="version">
	<h4>Version info</h4>
	<ul>
		<li>Current server version: <b id="server-version">{{ version[0]|e }}</b></li>
		<li>Server target version: <b id="server-version">{{ version[1]|e }}</b></li>
		<li>Extension version: <i id="ext-version">unknown or Improved Intra is not installed/enabled</i></li>
		<li>Browser: <i id="browser-info">unknown</i></li>
		<li>OS: <i id="os-info">unknown</i></li>
		<li><a href="https://github.com/FreekBes/improved_intra_server/releases" target="_blank">Server version history</a></li>
		<li><a href="https://github.com/FreekBes/improved_intra/releases" target="_blank">Extension version history</a></li>
	</ul>
</div>

<script>
const bowserInfo = bowser.parse(window.navigator.userAgent);
if (bowserInfo['browser']) {
	document.getElementById('browser-info').innerText = bowserInfo['browser']['name'] + ' ' + bowserInfo['browser']['version'];
}
if (bowserInfo['os']) {
	document.getElementById('os-info').innerText = bowserInfo['os']['name'] + ' ' + bowserInfo['os']['version'];
}
</script>

<div class="text-container" id="takeout">
	<h4>Privacy</h4>
	<p>You can find the Privacy Policy of the Improved Intra browser extension in our GitHub repository (<a href="https://github.com/FreekBes/improved_intra/blob/main/PRIVACY-POLICY.md">link</a>).</p>
	<p>As a user of Improved Intra, you can request a copy of all the data that Improved Intra has stored about you. This includes your Intra username, campus info, uploaded banners and some data related to your studies. You can download this data by clicking on the link below. The data will be given to you in ZIP format. Inside the ZIP archive, you can find JSON files containing all raw data Improved Intra has stored about you (excluding tokens), in addition to any files you have uploaded to our servers that we decided to keep.</p>
	<p><b><a href="{{ url_for('takeout') }}">Request a copy of my data</a></b></p>
	<p>You can <b>delete all data</b> Improved Intra has stored about you right here. This removes your settings, profile, uploaded banners and everything else listed above, signs you out, and <b>cannot be undone</b>. Signing in again afterwards creates a new, empty account.</p>
	<form id="delete-form" method="POST" action="{{ url_for('delete_account') }}">
		<input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{ csrf_token() }}" />
		<input type="hidden" name="confirmation" id="delete-confirmation" value="" />
		<button type="submit" class="link-button danger" id="delete-btn">Delete all my data</button>
	</form>
	<p>If this does not work, you can still request deletion by sending an e-mail to <a href="mailto:fbes@student.codam.nl">fbes@student.codam.nl</a>. <i>Make sure the e-mail contains proof that you are the owner of the account whose data you wish to have deleted.</i></p>
</div>

<script>
const deleteForm = document.getElementById('delete-form');
const deleteLogin = {{ user_login|tojson }};
deleteForm.addEventListener('submit', function(event) {
	event.preventDefault();
	if (!window.confirm('This permanently deletes everything Improved Intra has stored about you. This cannot be undone.\n\nContinue?')) {
		return;
	}
	const typed = window.prompt('To confirm, type your Intra login below:\n\n' + deleteLogin);
	if (typed === null) {
		return; // cancelled
	}
	if (typed.trim().toLowerCase() !== deleteLogin.toLowerCase()) {
		window.alert('That is not your login. Nothing has been deleted.');
		return;
	}
	document.getElementById('delete-confirmation').value = typed.trim();
	document.getElementById('delete-btn').disabled = true;
	deleteForm.submit();
});
</script>

{% endblock %}
